# Koleksi REST — Auth
#
# CARA PAKAI (REST Client humao di VS Code: klik "Send Request" di atas tiap blok)
#   - Variabel @baseUrl di bawah dipakai REST Client. http-client.env.json (env "local")
#     untuk httpyac/JetBrains; kalau memakainya, hapus baris @baseUrl di tiap berkas.
#   - Jalankan "register" (sekali), lalu "login". Berkas lain butuh token: salin
#     session.access_token dari respons login ke baris @token di berkas itu.
#     Token kedaluwarsa dalam 1 jam; jalankan "refresh" bila perlu.
#   - Rantai request (`{{login.response.body.$...}}`) memakai sintaks REST Client humao.
#
#   - Rate limit (per IP): register 3/jam; login DAN google berbagi 5 per 15 menit. Bila
#     kena 429, tunggu `Retry-After` atau restart `npm run dev` (penyimpanan di memori).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ============================================================
### POST /auth/register
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 201 {user, session}
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dey@example.com",
  "password": "rahasia-banget-123",
  "full_name": "Dey",
  "initial_balance": 2350000
}

### Error 409 CONFLICT: email sudah terdaftar (jalankan request di atas dua kali)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dey@example.com",
  "password": "rahasia-banget-123",
  "full_name": "Dey",
  "initial_balance": 0
}

### Error 400: email tidak sah
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bukan-email",
  "password": "rahasia-banget-123",
  "full_name": "Dey"
}

### Error 400: password kurang dari 8 karakter
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pendek@example.com",
  "password": "pendek",
  "full_name": "Dey"
}

### Error 400: saldo awal desimal (uang harus bilangan bulat rupiah)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "desimal@example.com",
  "password": "rahasia-banget-123",
  "full_name": "Dey",
  "initial_balance": 2350000.50
}

### Error 400: saldo awal negatif, nama terlalu pendek
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "negatif@example.com",
  "password": "rahasia-banget-123",
  "full_name": "D",
  "initial_balance": -1
}

### ============================================================
### POST /auth/login
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 200 {user, session}. Request ini diberi nama supaya request lain bisa memakai tokennya.
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dey@example.com",
  "password": "rahasia-banget-123"
}

### Error 401: password salah
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dey@example.com",
  "password": "salah-total"
}

### Error 400: body kosong
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ============================================================
### POST /auth/google
### ============================================================

# Login atau daftar dengan akun Google lewat ID token (bukan redirect browser).
# Mobile nanti mendapat id_token dari Google Sign-In native; untuk sekarang dapatkan satu
# secara manual, sekali saja. Prasyarat (sekali, gratis): OAuth client di Google Cloud
# Console, lalu Client ID dan Secret dimasukkan ke dashboard Supabase -> Authentication ->
# Providers -> Google, dengan Client ID yang dipakai di bawah ikut dicantumkan di
# "Authorized Client IDs".
#
# Cara A: Google OAuth Playground (https://developers.google.com/oauthplayground)
#   1. Klik ikon roda gigi (kanan atas) -> centang "Use your own OAuth credentials", isi
#      Client ID dan Secret dari Google Cloud Console. Tambahkan
#      https://developers.google.com/oauthplayground ke "Authorized redirect URIs" client itu.
#   2. Di Step 1 pilih scope "openid", "email", "profile" (ketik manual di kotak input),
#      klik "Authorize APIs", pilih akun Google.
#   3. Di Step 2 klik "Exchange authorization code for tokens". Salin nilai `id_token`
#      dari respons JSON (bukan access_token).
#
# Cara B: alur manual tanpa Playground
#   1. Buka di browser (ganti CLIENT_ID; redirect_uri harus terdaftar di client itu):
#      https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/v2/auth?client_id=CLIENT_ID&redirect_uri=http://localhost:3000&response_type=code&scope=openid%20email%20profile
#   2. Setelah persetujuan, salin parameter `code` dari URL tujuan.
#   3. Tukar kodenya (curl atau request REST Client):
#      POST https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token
#      Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
#      code=KODE&client_id=CLIENT_ID&client_secret=SECRET&redirect_uri=http://localhost:3000&grant_type=authorization_code
#      Salin `id_token` dari responsnya.
#
# Catatan: id_token berlaku sekitar 1 jam. Bila Supabase menolak dengan pesan soal nonce
# atau audience, periksa Client ID di dashboard Supabase.
#
# Sukses: 200 {user, session}. Login pertama membuat akun "Tunai" dan salinan kategori;
# login berikutnya dengan akun yang sama tidak membuat apa pun.
# @name google
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_token": "GANTI_DENGAN_ID_TOKEN_GOOGLE"
}

### Error 401: id_token tidak valid atau kedaluwarsa
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_token": "token-ngawur"
}

### Error 409: email yang sama sudah terdaftar lewat password dan Supabase menolak menautkan
# (bergantung pengaturan "manual linking" di dashboard Supabase). Untuk mencobanya: jalankan
# "register" di atas dengan email akun Google Anda, lalu kirim id_token akun itu ke sini.
# Bila penautan otomatis aktif, hasilnya justru 200 (masuk ke akun yang sama).
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_token": "GANTI_DENGAN_ID_TOKEN_DARI_AKUN_DENGAN_EMAIL_YANG_SUDAH_TERDAFTAR"
}

### Error 400: id_token kosong
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_token": ""
}

### Error 400: body kosong
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ============================================================
### POST /auth/refresh
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 200 {session}. Memakai refresh_token dari request "login" di atas.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{login.response.body.$.session.refresh_token}}"
}

### Error 401: refresh token tidak dikenal
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "token-ngawur"
}

### Error 400: refresh_token kosong
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": ""
}

### ============================================================
### POST /auth/logout
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.session.access_token}}

### Error 401: tanpa token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### ============================================================
### POST /auth/forgot-password
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 200 {message}. Pesan sama untuk email terdaftar maupun tidak.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dey@example.com"
}

### Error 400: email tidak sah
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bukan-email"
}

### ============================================================
### POST /auth/reset-password
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 204. Isi token dengan access_token dari tautan di email reset.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "GANTI_DENGAN_TOKEN_PEMULIHAN_DARI_EMAIL",
  "password": "password-baru-456"
}

### Error 401: token pemulihan tidak valid
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "token-ngawur",
  "password": "password-baru-456"
}

### Error 400: password baru terlalu pendek
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "token-ngawur",
  "password": "pendek"
}

### ============================================================
### Demo (claude/DEMO-SCRIPT.md, langkah 1): pengguna baru
### ============================================================

# Ganti @demoEmail dengan alamat yang belum pernah terdaftar (latihan sebelumnya sudah memakai
# yang lama, hasilnya 409). Domain example.com diterima Supabase; bila ditolak, pakai domain lain.
# Register dibatasi 3 per jam per IP.
@demoEmail = penguji-1@example.com
@demoPassword = rahasia-banget-123

# Sukses: 201 {user, session}. Saldo awal Rp1.000.000 supaya dashboard langsung bermakna.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{demoEmail}}",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}",
  "full_name": "Penguji Satu",
  "initial_balance": 1000000
}

###

# Sukses: 200 {user, session}. Salin session.access_token ke @token di transactions.http,
# dashboard.http, dan whatsapp.http.
# @name demoLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{demoEmail}}",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}
